        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_666c0df339364da0b8dd0ca5496b1fcb",
      "statement": "The training recipe is derived from a d12 reference: scaling params are transformer matrices plus lm_head, target tokens are --target-param-data-ratio times scaling params, the batch size follows B_REF * (D/D_REF)^0.383 rounded to a power of two unless overridden, all LRs scale by sqrt(B/B_REF), and Muon weight decay scales by sqrt(B/B_REF) * (D_REF/D).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/base_train.py#L258-L316",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f2835f01dc8168946598229c3dc11a65dbe086226e43ccd68d1b450cdfedcab9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_54943fe1d4e34bf49cc3f02d08fc832f",
      "statement": "The iteration count comes from exactly one source in precedence order: --num-iterations if positive, else --target-flops, else target tokens divided by the total batch size; at least one must be set.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/base_train.py#L336-L357",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2f884f36b2a6dbcdc00a7d053d0ca7c772e749cecc60912d2ab031f53213dba8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6190a3447371467c8c18cf4fa9ea1ff4",
      "statement": "Three step schedules are applied to optimizer groups each step: an LR multiplier with --warmup-steps warm-up and --warmdown-ratio linear warm-down to --final-lr-frac, Muon momentum ramping 0.85 to 0.97 over 400 steps then down to 0.90 during warm-down, and Muon weight decay cosine-decayed to zero over the run.",
      "evidence": [
